OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over 'sophisticated'
OL,4,Aoperation to grow 300 cannabis plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged by police after
OL,7,Fabout 300 cannabis plants were
OL,8,Fdiscovered in County Armagh.
OL,10,FPolice found the plants, which were
OL,11,Fgrowing across rooms in outbuildings
OL,12,Fand sheds at a property on the Moy Road
OL,13,Fin Portadown, at approximately 19:15
OL,14,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,16,FWhen the officers arrived a man
OL,17,Fattempted to make off from the scene
OL,18,Fafter coming out of a static caravan
OL,19,Flocated in the area.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
