OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over 'sophisticated'
OL,4,Aoperation to grow 300 cannabis plants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 32-year-old was detained a short time
OL,7,Flater, arrested and then charged with
OL,8,Fsuspicion of being concerned in the
OL,9,Fsupply of a Class B drug, cultivating
OL,10,Fcannabis, possession of a Class B
OL,11,Fcontrolled drug with intent to supply
OL,12,Fand dishonestly using electricity.
